# Toph, Hardheaded Teacher: "Whenever you cast a spell, earthbend 1. If that spell is a Lesson, put an additional +1/+1 counter on
# that land." Bot1's Lightning Bolt (not a Lesson) earthbends Plains into a 1/1 haste land creature. Octopus Form (an instant Lesson, on
# Toph) earthbends the same land again: its counter and the additional one, 3/3. The Plains is the only land.

